    ("The Picture of Dorian Gray", "Oscar Wilde", 1890, "Gothic fiction", "A portrait bears the consequences of its subject's choices."),
    ("The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes", "Arthur Conan Doyle", 1892, "Mystery", "Twelve cases of deduction and intrigue."),
    ("Middlemarch", "George Eliot", 1871, "Classic fiction", "The intertwined lives of a provincial English town."),
